ADC/DAC Interface
CONFIG_GRADCDAC_ENABLE
  Say Y here to enable the external ADC/DAC interface controller.

ADC/DAC Data Width
CONFIG_GRADCDAC_DWIDTH
  Sets the width of the external ADC/DAC data interface.
  Only 16-bit width is currently supported.

ADC/DAC Address Width
CONFIG_GRADCDAC_ABITS
  Set the width of the data pointers used for the circular buffers placed in memory.
  Only 8-bit width is currently supported.

ADC/DAC Interrupt
CONFIG_GRADCDAC_IRQ
  Set the interrupt number for the first ADC/DAC interrupt. The remaining interrupt
  will have an incrementing interrupt number. A zero value disables all interrupts.
